@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Billing disputes
+
+The billing implementation defines `refundWindowDays` in `/src/billing.ts`; its current value is 30 days. Use that value when explaining the refund request window, but do not treat timing eligibility as refund approval or promise that a refund will be issued.
+
+No invoice lookup, invoice adjustment, or refund-approval capability is implemented in this repository. For invoice questions, distinguish customer-provided facts from verified billing records, do not invent an invoice status, balance, payment, adjustment, or outcome, and escalate disputes that require records or actions the available implementation cannot provide.

